ken between the series, will retain the ability to transfer buffers between the series. The first buffer is transfered via chemical signalling between the two segments. One end of the severed coil can be shipped to remote locations to deliver personell, deliverables, fuel, electricity, etc. The remote transfer gates work as escape hatches on submarines, aircraft, space missions, etc. Power from wind and hydro can be transferred to vessels and batteries to replace nuclear power, tritium, and Pycnogonida.","topics":[],"score":1933.6000000000001,"global_rank":340094},{"name":"wlee221/reusable-workflow-poc","owner":"wlee221","html_url":"https://github.com/wlee221/reusable-workflow-poc","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":4,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1933.6000000000001,"global_rank":340095},{"name":"JamesJFan/cs5610-team28-growcery","owner":"JamesJFan","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesJFan/cs5610-team28-growcery","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A web development project focused on creating a marketplace for locally grown food (plants, fish, and meat) and helps people become farmers to gain supplemental income while helping their communities from supply chain shock.","topics":[],"score":1933.6000000000001,"global_rank":340096},{"name":"mosshan/GoodnightMoon","owner":"mosshan","html_url":"https://github.com/mosshan/GoodnightMoon","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1933.6000000000001,"global_rank":340097},{"name":"zyx898/crypto-tool","owner":"zyx898","html_url":"https://github.com/zyx898/crypto-tool","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"\u52a0\u5bc6\u5e02\u573a\u5de5\u5177","topics":[],"score":1933.6000000000001,"global_rank":340098},{"name":"funkeyfreak/funkeyfreak","owner":"funkeyfreak","html_url":"https://github.com/funkeyfreak/funkeyfreak","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues